#3702
A Rocky Island~
   You stand on the western edge of a small, rocky island which sits under the
shadow of Mount Kolvir away to the east. You can quite clearly see the other
side of the island, although the path is by no means an easy one - jagged
rocks protrude through the island surface like misshapen teeth, threatening to
tear you to shreds as you travel.
