#3703
A Rocky Island~
   As you make your way through the maze of rocks and boulders of this island,
you come across a circular stone buried in the ground. It's certainly not
natural, as most of the surrounding rocks were formed as part of an ancient
volcanic eruption and clearly shows the signs of having been forced up through
the earth.
~
