#3704
A Rocky Island~
   Taking a moment of rest, you gaze at the landscape before you. Dominating
the eastern skyline is the forebidding peak of Mount Kolvir, while surrounding
the rocky island you are now on are the clear waters of Lake Argos. The fiery
glow of volcanic activity can be seen through narrow fissures in the island
surface, indicating that perhaps this land is not quite at rest...
~
