A Rocky Island~
   There is a faint, yet noticeable vibration from the surrounding rocks which
mark the coastline of this island. It acts as a source for the many ripples
which propogate outwards towards the far shore of the lake to the west. Should
you decide to explore the remainder of the island, you can clamber your way to
east or traverse the coast to the north.
