A Rocky Island~
   A thin ledge of rock extending into the lake marks the southern edge of
this small island. Pockets of mist pass you by like ships in the night, almost
as if they had a mind of their own. The cold waters of Lake Argos lie to the
east, south and west while the remainder of the island stretches away to the
north.
